<title>USA: U.S. vegoil product output/stocks - Census.</title>
<headline>U.S. vegoil product output/stocks - Census.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census Bureau reported selected edible product output as follows (Mln Lbs):</p>
<p>				   July 96    June 96    July 95</p>
<p>   Baking or Frying Fats     465.4     470.3-R    456.6</p>
<p>   Soy Salad/Cooking Oil     441.9     414.6-R    439.2</p>
<p> Other Salad/Cooking Oil	90.7     106.8-R    106.9</p>
<p>		   Margarine     168.4     181.1-R    162.8</p>
<p>	   Glycerine Crude	22.6	29.8	 30.7</p>
<p>		     Refined	25.1	29.8	 31.6</p>
<p>		 Fatty Acids     143.2     145.6	147.8</p>
<p>	 Meat/Meal Tankage     484.6     456.6	447.9</p>
<p>PRODUCER/WAREHOUSE STOCKS OF SELECTED EDIBLE PRODUCTS:</p>
<p>		  (Mln Lbs) --  July 96  June 96  July 95</p>
<p>    Baking and Frying Fats    86.8     93.7-R   95.6</p>
<p> Soybean Salad/Cooking Oil    66.3     63.8-R   62.5</p>
<p>   Other Salad/Cooking Oil    32.5     38.4     30.8</p>
<p>		     Margarine    42.3     46.0-R   74.8</p>
<p>	     Glycerine Crude    56.0     53.5-R   24.3</p>
<p>	   Glycerine Refined    22.1     24.0     16.0</p>
<p>		   Fatty Acids   102.6    109.1    122.7</p>
